      <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-body" data-reveal>
        Male factors are involved in a substantial share of couples' infertility, which is why
        both partners are assessed from the start. As an andrologist, Dr. Kamran looks for the
        cause rather than treating a semen report in isolation. Common causes include:
      </p>
