      <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-body">
        The World Health Organization defines infertility as not achieving pregnancy after 12
        months or more of regular, unprotected intercourse. Guidance is based on how long you
        have been trying, your age and your medical history, not on how long you have been
        married. Fertility societies generally advise evaluation as follows:
      </p>
      <ul class="mt-4 list-disc space-y-2 pl-6 leading-relaxed text-body">
        {timing.map((item) => <li>{item}</li>)}
